<section>
    <h2>Harmony in Design</h2>

    <p>The relationship between music and visual design has been understood since antiquity. The same ratios that create
        consonant musical intervals also create pleasing visual proportions.</p>

    <p>unit.gl includes these classical ratios as first-class citizens:</p>

    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Ratio</th>
                <th>Value</th>
                <th>Musical Interval</th>
                <th>Use Case</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Minor Second</strong></td>
                <td>1.067</td>
                <td>Semitone</td>
                <td>Subtle variations, micro-adjustments</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Major Second</strong></td>
                <td>1.125</td>
                <td>Whole tone</td>
                <td>Text sizes, tight scales</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Minor Third</strong></td>
                <td>1.2</td>
                <td>—</td>
                <td>Balanced typography</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Major Third</strong></td>
                <td>1.25</td>
                <td>—</td>
                <td>Clear hierarchy</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Perfect Fourth</strong></td>
                <td>1.333</td>
                <td>—</td>
                <td>Strong contrast</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Perfect Fifth</strong></td>
                <td>1.5</td>
                <td>—</td>
                <td>Classic proportions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Golden Ratio</strong></td>
                <td>1.618</td>
                <td>—</td>
                <td>Natural beauty, organic feel</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>These ratios power the <code>modular_scale()</code> function, allowing you to create type scales, spacing
        systems, and layouts that feel inherently harmonious.</p>
</section>
